# GitHub has no grammar for FPL, so .fpl files show as plain text. Clojure's
# grammar is the nearest one it has: it colours ; comments, strings, numbers
# and brackets, and leaves the frame bar alone (Scheme would read |...| as a
# quoted symbol). The minus keeps FPL out of the repository's language bar.
*.fpl linguist-language=Clojure -linguist-detectable
